{"id":"73e3feb902982212","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-dspace-var.md","title":"确定性多项式空间与迭代量词块变量界","display":"thm-dspace-var — 确定性多项式空间与迭代量词块变量界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-dspace-var","aliases":["29-thm-dspace-var"],"display":"thm-dspace-var — 确定性多项式空间与迭代量词块变量界","depends_on":["[[29-df-var]]","[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","[[29-df-iter]]","[[29-lem-iter-space]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 10.16; Lemmas 10.17, 10.20, 10.21, pp.163–165, DjVu scans 178–180","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-dspace-var"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-dspace-var</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dspace-var — 确定性多项式空间与迭代量词块变量界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6af0200f99b76e3\" href=\"?note=e6af0200f99b76e3\" title=\"29-df-var\">29-df-var</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" href=\"?note=bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" title=\"29-df-iter\">29-df-iter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4350a4d66b0db7a7\" href=\"?note=4350a4d66b0db7a7\" title=\"29-lem-iter-space\">29-lem-iter-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 10.16; Lemmas 10.17, 10.20, 10.21, pp.163–165, DjVu scans 178–180"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇，保留符号的角色满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a> 的约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\subseteq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\">\\(E_\\tau:\\mathcal O_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a>。原始输入是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\">\\(U=(A,L)\\)</span>，实际编码与满足关系的结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau(U)\">\\(E_\\tau(U)\\)</span>；该扩张保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的全部解释，序与端点不重复加入。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)=\\operatorname{card}(|E_\\tau(U)|)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)=\\operatorname{card}(|E_\\tau(U)|)\\)</span>，编码长度另记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(n^k)\">\\(O(n^k)\\)</span> 工作带空间约定，输入只读，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VAR}[k+1,\\tau]\">\\(\\operatorname{VAR}[k+1,\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e6af0200f99b76e3\" href=\"?note=e6af0200f99b76e3\" title=\"29-df-var\">29-df-var</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau^\\uparrow]\">\\(\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau^\\uparrow]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" href=\"?note=bc4ad8dba28adfd5\" title=\"29-df-iter\">29-df-iter</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}^{\\uparrow}[n^k,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{DSPACE}^{\\uparrow}[n^k,\\tau]\\)</span> 在下面定义为扩张结构上的机器查询类沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span> 拉回到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span> 的查询类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau^{-1}[Q]\">\\(E_\\tau^{-1}[Q]\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{U\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\mid E_\\tau(U)\\in Q\\}\">\\(\\{U\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\mid E_\\tau(U)\\in Q\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}^{\\uparrow}[n^k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DSPACE}^{\\uparrow}[n^k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau^\\uparrow]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}^{\\uparrow}[n^k,\\tau]=\\operatorname{VAR}[k+1,\\tau]=\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau^\\uparrow]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DSPACE}^{\\uparrow}[n^k,\\tau]=\\operatorname{VAR}[k+1,\\tau]=\\{E_\\tau^{-1}[Q]\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau^\\uparrow]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 10.16，印刷页163、扫描页178的三项等式已查看原图；三段证明见 Lemmas 10.17、10.20、10.21，印刷页164–165、扫描页179–180。已核对证明结构；未逐项重验 Claim 10.19 中的全部量词块符号变换。本次补回原书的 ITER 项，并把机器类及关系迭代类显式拉回到 VAR 使用的同一有序对论域，避免直接比较结构查询与有序对查询。空间上界的本地逐项论证另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"4350a4d66b0db7a7\" href=\"?note=4350a4d66b0db7a7\" title=\"29-lem-iter-space\">29-lem-iter-space</a>。旧文件以有限变量 FO(PFP) 替代 VAR，不能据该定理取得相同结论；已有正文纠正继续保留。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 始终为域大小，不能因输入词汇元数改变而换成编码长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-var","status":"resolved","id":"e6af0200f99b76e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-var]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iter","status":"resolved","id":"bc4ad8dba28adfd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iter]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-lem-iter-space","status":"resolved","id":"4350a4d66b0db7a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-lem-iter-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iter